                                "sense_id": "427c7249-03a8-3337-928d-fe386bfb6c58",
                                "text": "Pfizer has made nearly $26bn (£21bn) in revenues in the first three months of the year, the bulk from its Covid-19 vaccine and new pill to treat the virus, prompting fresh accusations of pandemic profiteering."
                            }
                        ]
